1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,301
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,301 --> 00:00:03,445
Let's play a guessing game!

3
00:00:03,995 --> 00:00:06,656
Listen to the clue, then guess!

4
00:00:08,006 --> 00:00:09,768
It says moo!

5
00:00:10,168 --> 00:00:11,906
What is this?

6
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:16,337
It's a cow!

7
00:00:16,887 --> 00:00:18,076
You got it!

8
00:00:19,426 --> 00:00:21,593
It is yellow and yummy.

9
00:00:21,993 --> 00:00:23,731
What is this?

10
00:00:26,831 --> 00:00:28,767
It's a banana!

11
00:00:29,317 --> 00:00:30,506
You got it!

12
00:00:31,856 --> 00:00:33,785
It goes beep, beep!

13
00:00:34,185 --> 00:00:35,923
What is this?

14
00:00:39,023 --> 00:00:40,636
It's a car!

15
00:00:41,186 --> 00:00:42,375
You got it!

16
00:00:43,725 --> 00:00:45,892
It swims in the water.

17
00:00:46,292 --> 00:00:48,030
What is this?

18
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:52,723
It's a fish!

19
00:00:53,273 --> 00:00:54,462
You got it!

20
00:00:55,812 --> 00:00:57,931
It shines in the sky.

21
00:00:58,331 --> 00:01:00,069
What is this?

22
00:01:03,169 --> 00:01:04,903
It's the sun!

23
00:01:05,453 --> 00:01:06,643
You got it!

24
00:01:07,993 --> 00:01:10,350
You can bounce it and roll it.

25
00:01:10,750 --> 00:01:12,488
What is this?

26
00:01:15,588 --> 00:01:17,140
It's a ball!

27
00:01:17,690 --> 00:01:18,880
You got it!

28
00:01:20,230 --> 00:01:22,230
It says quack, quack!

29
00:01:22,630 --> 00:01:24,368
What is this?

30
00:01:27,468 --> 00:01:28,980
It's a duck!

31
00:01:29,530 --> 00:01:30,719
You got it!

32
00:01:32,069 --> 00:01:34,307
We brush our teeth with it.

33
00:01:34,707 --> 00:01:36,446
What is this?

34
00:01:39,546 --> 00:01:41,521
It's a toothbrush!

35
00:01:42,071 --> 00:01:43,261
You got it!

36
00:01:44,611 --> 00:01:46,563
It twinkles at night.

37
00:01:46,963 --> 00:01:48,701
What is this?

38
00:01:51,801 --> 00:01:53,475
It's a star!

39
00:01:54,025 --> 00:01:55,214
You got it!

40
00:01:56,564 --> 00:01:58,636
We sleep in it at night.

41
00:01:59,036 --> 00:02:00,774
What is this?

42
00:02:03,874 --> 00:02:05,507
It's a bed!

43
00:02:06,057 --> 00:02:07,246
You got it!

44
00:02:08,596 --> 00:02:11,096
You are a super guesser!

45
00:02:11,646 --> 00:02:13,884
Great job, little learner!

46
00:02:14,434 --> 00:02:16,323
Share Mimzi with a friend,

47
00:02:16,323 --> 00:02:18,863
and subscribe for more learning fun!

48
00:02:19,413 --> 00:02:20,401
Next time,

49
00:02:20,401 --> 00:02:22,759
let's count from one to ten.

50
00:02:23,009 --> 00:02:24,380
Bye bye!
